# Limen Bazel configuration.
#
# The options shared with rowkeydb, rowkeyraft and zetasketch-cpp are in
# bazel/build_infra/shared.bazelrc, a checked copy of
# rowkeydb-com/rowkeydb-build-infra's, imported first: the compilers, the
# C++ standard, the warnings, the options of all code, the release,
# sanitizer, clang-tidy, coverage and BuildBuddy configurations, and the
# image every action runs in. The lines after it are Limen's own; each is
# on the allowlist that repository keeps for Limen, with its reason, and
# its scripts/check.sh refuses any other.

import %workspace%/bazel/build_infra/shared.bazelrc

# The OpenTelemetry C++ SDK's ABI version 2, from the shared group, so
# that the SDK is compiled as rowkeydb, which links Limen, compiles it,
# and the two share its compilations.
build --config=opentelemetry
